  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 9,
    "summary": "A messianic psalm of David—He praises the Lord for rebuking the nations—The Lord will judge the world in righteousness—He will dwell in Zion—The wicked will be sent to hell.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "I will praise thee, O Lord, with my whole heart; I will shew forth all thy marvellous works.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 75,
            "end": 85,
            "text": "1 Chr. 16:9 (8–9); Ps. 26:7; D&C 76:114."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 14,
            "end": 19
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 9:1",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "I will be glad and rejoice in thee: I will sing praise to thy name, O thou most High.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 9:2",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "When mine enemies are turned back, they shall fall and perish at thy presence.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 9:3",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "For thou hast maintained my right and my cause; thou satest in the throne judging right.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 9:4",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast rebuked the heathen, thou hast destroyed the wicked, thou hast put out their name for ever and ever.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 73,
            "end": 80,
            "text": "Deut. 9:14 (13–14); Mosiah 26:36."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 9:5",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "O thou enemy, destructions are come to a perpetual end: and thou hast destroyed cities; their memorial is perished with them.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 9:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 9,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
